{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-1","title":"2 Timothy 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He advertises him of the times to come; 6 describes the enemies of the truth; 10 propounds unto him his own example; 16 and commends the holy scriptures;</p>\n<p>in. 4:3; Ge 49:1; Isa 2:2; Jer 48:47; 49:39; Eze 38:16; Da 10:14; Ho 3:5 Mic 4:1; 1Ti 4:1; 2Pe 3:3; 1Jo 2:18; Jude 1:17 perilous. Da 7:8,20-25; 8:8-14; 11:36-45; 12:1,7,11; 2Th 2:3-12; 1Ti 4:1-3 Re 8:1-17:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-2","title":"2 Timothy 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>lovers. 4; Ro 15:1-3; 2Co 5:15; Php 2:21; Jas 2:8 covetous. Lu 12:15; Ro 1:29; Col 3:5; 2Pe 2:3,14,15; Jude 1:11,16; Re 18:12,13 boasters. Ps 10:3; 49:6; 52:1; Isa 10:15; Ac 5:36; Ro 1:29-31; 11:18; 2Th 2:4 Jas 4:16; 2Pe 2:18; Jude 1:16 proud. Pr 6:17; 1Ti 6:4; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5 blasphemers. Da 7:25; 11:36; 1Ti 1:20; 2Pe 2:12; Jude 1:10; Re 13:1,5,6; 16:9,11,21 disobedient. Mt 15:6; Mr 7:11,12; Ro 1:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-3","title":"2 Timothy 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>natural. Mt 10:21; Ro 1:31 trucebreakers. 2Sa 21:1-3; Ps 15:4; Eze 17:15-19; Ro 1:31; *Gr: false accusers. or, make-bates. Mt 4:1; Joh 6:70; 1Ti 3:11; Tit 2:3 All in Gr. incontinent. 1Co 7:5,9; 2Pe 2:14,19; 3:3; Jude 1:16,18 fierce. Ge 49:7; Da 8:23; Re 13:15,17; 16:6; 17:6 despisers. Ps 22:6; Isa 53:3; 60:14; Lu 10:16; 16:14; 1Th 4:8; Jas 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-4","title":"2 Timothy 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Traitors. 2Pe 2:10-22; Jude 1:8,9 high-minded. Ro 11:20; 1Ti 6:17 lovers of God. Ro 16:18; Php 3:18,19; 1Ti 5:6; 2Pe 2:13,15; Jude 1:4,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-5","title":"2 Timothy 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>a form. Isa 29:13; 48:1,2; 58:1-3; Eze 33:30-32; Mt 7:15; 23:27,28 Ro 2:20-24; 1Ti 5:8; Tit 1:16 from. 2:16,23; Ro 16:17,18; Eph 4:14; 2Th 3:6,14; 1Ti 6:5; Tit 3:10 2Jo 1:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-6","title":"2 Timothy 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>of this. Mt 23:14; Tit 1:11; Jude 1:4 laden. Ps 38:4; Isa 1:4; Mt 11:28 led. 1Co 12:2; 2Pe 3:17 divers. Mr 4:19; 1Ti 6:9; Tit 3:3; 2Pe 2:18; Jude 1:16,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-7","title":"2 Timothy 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>learning. 4:3,4; De 29:4; Pr 14:6; Isa 30:10,11; Eze 14:4-10; Mt 13:11 Joh 3:20,21; 5:44; 12:42,43; 1Co 3:1-4; Eph 4:14; Heb 5:11 never. 1Ti 2:4 the knowledge. 2:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-8","title":"2 Timothy 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>as. Ex 7:11,22; 8:7,18 resist. 4:15; 1Ki 22:22-24; Jer 28:1-17; Ac 13:8-11; 15:24; Ga 1:7-9; 2:4,5 Eph 4:14; 2Th 2:9-11; Tit 1:10; 2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 2:18; 4:1 Re 2:6,14,15,20 men. Ac 8:21,22; Ro 1:28; 16:18; 2Co 11:13-15; 1Ti 1:19; 4:2; 6:5 Tit 1:16; 2Pe 2:14; Jude 1:18,19 reprobate. or, of no judgment. 2Co 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-9","title":"2 Timothy 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>their. 8; Ex 7:12; 8:18,19; 9:11; 1Ki 22:25; Ps 76:10; Jer 28:15-17 Jer 29:21-23,31,32; 37:19; Ac 13:11; 19:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-10","title":"2 Timothy 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thou hast fully known. or, thou hast been a diligent followerof. Lu 1:3; Php 2:22; 1Ti 4:6; *Gr: my. 16,17; 4:3; Ac 2:42; Ro 16:17; Eph 4:14; 1Ti 1:3; 4:12,13; Tit 2:7 Heb 13:9; 2Jo 1:9,10 manner. Ac 20:18; 26:4; 1Th 1:5; 2Pe 3:11 purpose. Da 1:8; Ac 11:23; 2Co 1:17 faith. 2:22; 2Co 6:4-10; 1Ti 4:12; 6:11; 2Pe 1:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-11","title":"2 Timothy 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Persecutions. Ac 9:16; 20:19,23,24; Ro 8:35-37; 1Co 4:9-11; 2Co 1:8-10; 4:8-11 2Co 11:23-28; Heb 10:33-34 at Antioch. Ac 13:45,50,51; 14:2,5,6,19-21 but. 4:7,17,18; Ge 48:16; 2Sa 22:1,49; Job 5:19,20; Ps 34:19; 37:40 Ps 91:2-6,14; Isa 41:10,14; 43:2; Jer 1:19; Da 6:27; Ac 9:23-25 Ac 21:32,33; 23:10,12-24; 25:3,4; 26:17,22; 2Co 1:10; 2Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-12","title":"2 Timothy 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>live. 2Co 1:12; 1Ti 2:2; 3:16; 6:3; Tit 1:1; 2:12; 2Pe 3:11 shall. Jos 17:14; Ps 37:12-15; Mt 5:10-12; 10:22-25; 16:24; 23:34; Mr 10:30 Lu 14:26,27; Joh 15:19-21; 16:2,33; 17:14; Ac 14:22; 1Co 15:19 1Th 3:3,4; Heb 11:32-38; 1Pe 2:20,21; 3:14; 4:12-16; 5:9,10 Re 1:9,10; 7:14; 12:4,7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-13","title":"2 Timothy 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>evil. 8; 2:16,17; 2Th 2:6-10; 1Ti 4:1; 2Pe 2:20; 3:3; Re 12:9; 13:14; 18:23 being. Job 12:16; Isa 44:20; Eze 14:9,10; 2Th 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-14","title":"2 Timothy 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>continue. 1:13; 2:2; 1Ti 4:16 assured. Ac 17:31; Ro 14:5; *marg: Col 2:2; 1Th 1:5; Heb 6:11; 10:22 knowing. 15; 1Th 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-15","title":"2 Timothy 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>from. 1:5; 1Sa 2:18; 2Ch 34:3; Ps 71:17; Pr 8:17; 22:6; Ec 12:1; Lu 1:15 Lu 2:40 the holy. Da 10:21; Mt 22:29; Lu 24:27,32,45; Ac 17:2; Ro 1:2; 16:26 1Co 15:3,4; 2Pe 1:20,21; 3:16 which. Ps 19:7; Joh 5:39,40; Ac 10:43; 13:29,38,39; 1Pe 1:10-12 1Jo 5:11,12; Re 19:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-16","title":"2 Timothy 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>All. 2Sa 23:2; Mt 21:42; 22:31,32,43; 26:54,56; Mr 12:24,36; Joh 10:35 Ac 1:16; 28:25; Ro 3:2; 15:4; Ga 3:8; Heb 3:7; 4:12; 2Pe 1:19-21 and is. Ps 19:7-11; 119:97-104,130; Mic 2:7; Ac 20:20,27; 1Co 12:7 Eph 4:11-16 for doctrine. 10 for reproof. 4:2; Pr 6:23; 15:10,31; Joh 3:20; Eph 5:11-13; Heb 11:1; *Gr: for instruction. 2:25; De 4:36; Ne 9:20; Ps 119:9,11; Mt 13:52; Ac 18:25; Ro 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-3-17","title":"2 Timothy 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the man. Ps 119:98-100; 1Ti 6:11 throughly furnished. or, perfected. 2:21; Ne 2:18; Ac 9:36; 2Co 9:8; Eph 2:10; Tit 2:14; 3:1; Heb 10:24</p>"}]}